.TH WORDCOUNT 3 "September 2026" "OS Assignment" "Library Functions"
.SH NAME
wordCount \- count lines, words, and characters in a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.PP
.B int wordCount(FILE *fp, int *lines, int *words, int *characters);
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B wordCount
reads a file and counts the number of lines, words, and characters.
The results are returned through the supplied pointer arguments.
The function returns a status value indicating whether the operation
was successful.
